@startuml UC70A_PaymentNotification
!theme plain
title UC70A: Thông báo payment

actor System
participant "Backend Service" as Service
participant "Socket.IO" as Socket
database "Database" as DB

System -> Service: Event: Payment status changed\n(paymentId, status: completed/failed/refunded)
Service -> DB: Tìm payment theo ID\n(populate booking, customer)
DB --> Service: Payment data

Service -> DB: Tạo notification\n(type: payment_received/payment_failed/payment_refunded)
Service -> DB: Set recipients\n(customer + admin/staff)
DB --> Service: Notification created

Service -> Socket: Emit "payment_notification"\n(payment data, status, notification message)
Socket -> Socket: Broadcast đến users\n(customerId room, role:admin, role:staff)
Socket --> Frontend: Real-time notification

Frontend -> Frontend: Update UI\n(badge unread, payment history)
Frontend --> User: Hiển thị notification\n(toast, badge)

Service -> DB: Cập nhật badge unread count\n(recipients)
DB --> Service: Updated

note right
  Notification types:
  - payment_received: Thanh toán thành công
  - payment_failed: Thanh toán thất bại
  - payment_refunded: Đã hoàn tiền
  Tự động cập nhật badge và lịch sử
end note
@enduml

